@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@aliceToken = replace-with-token-from-login
@bobToken = replace-with-token-from-login
@unrelatedUserToken = replace-with-a-valid-token-for-a-user-not-related-to-the-mail
@mailId = 1
@attachmentId = 1

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Unauthorized inbox should return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/inbox

### Register Alice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "username": "Alice",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Register Bob
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "username": "Bob",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login Alice, copy data.token to aliceToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login Bob, copy data.token to bobToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Alice sends mail to Bob, copy data.mailId to mailId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/send
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": ["bob@example.com"],
  "cc": [],
  "subject": "实训通知",
  "content": "请按时提交周报。"
}

### Bob inbox should contain the mail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Alice sent box should contain the mail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/sent
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### Bob opens mail detail, which marks the mail as read
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/detail/{{mailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Alice uploads an attachment for the sent mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/attachment/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=UploadBoundary

--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mailId"

{{mailId}}
--UploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="stage3-demo.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

第三阶段附件上传下载测试文件。
--UploadBoundary--

### Query attachments by mail id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachment/mail/{{mailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### Receiver downloads attachment successfully
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachment/download/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Unrelated user cannot query the attachment list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachment/mail/{{mailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{unrelatedUserToken}}

### Unrelated user cannot download the attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachment/download/{{attachmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{unrelatedUserToken}}

### Missing attachment returns 404 without exposing a server path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/attachment/download/999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### Bob marks the mail as unread
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/unread/{{mailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Bob marks the mail as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/read/{{mailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Bob deletes the mail from inbox
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/{{mailId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Bob inbox should no longer contain the mail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Bob trash should contain the deleted mail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{bobToken}}

### Alice sent box should still contain the mail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/sent
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}

### Sending to a missing receiver should return a business error
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mail/send
Authorization: Bearer {{aliceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": ["missing@example.com"],
  "cc": [],
  "subject": "错误场景",
  "content": "这个请求应该返回收件人不存在。"
}
